<h2>Contoh kalimat</h2>
Contoh kalimat.
Berikut adalah beberapa contoh kalimat yang menggunakan idiom ini:
<ul>
<li>We don't need to reinvent the wheel, we just need to hire someone who already knows how to make the system work.</li>
<li>As regards designing a user interface, it is often best to follow established standards and conventions—don’t reinvent the wheel.</li>
<li>Fortunately, there is no need to start from scratch and reinvent the wheel.</li>
</ul>
